<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1975695800"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1639100741"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Light Years"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="麻枝准 / やなぎなぎ"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Light Years"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:43.999"><div begin="00:31.412" end="04:43.999"><p begin="00:31.412" end="00:36.662" itunes:key="L1">覚えてる熱い気持ちを<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我还记得那沸腾的热情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o bo e te ru a tsu i ki mo chi wo</span></p><p begin="00:36.663" end="00:46.363" itunes:key="L2">泣いたのも叫んだのも自分<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">尽情痛哭 放声呐喊的人都是自己</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na i ta no mo sa ke n da no mo ji bu n</span></p><p begin="00:46.364" end="00:54.056" itunes:key="L3">誰のために きみのために<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">为了他人 为了你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">da re no ta me ni ki mi no ta me ni</span></p><p begin="00:54.057" end="01:02.182" itunes:key="L4">好きなものもあったんだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我也曾有过喜欢钟情的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki na mo no mo a 't ta n da</span></p><p begin="01:02.930" end="01:04.737" itunes:key="L5">さよなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见 再见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra sa yo na ra</span></p><p begin="01:04.738" end="01:06.677" itunes:key="L6">さよなら</p><p begin="01:06.678" end="01:08.644" itunes:key="L7">落ちてく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所有的一切都坠落而下 消散无踪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o chi te ku na ni mo ka mo ki e te ku</span></p><p begin="01:08.645" end="01:17.753" itunes:key="L8">なにもかも消えてく遠くなる</p><p begin="01:18.324" end="01:20.213" itunes:key="L9">会いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想见你 好想见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta i a i ta i</span></p><p begin="01:20.214" end="01:22.199" itunes:key="L10">会いたい</p><p begin="01:22.200" end="01:24.140" itunes:key="L11">いつか行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">只要这感情仍残存我心中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka yu ku</span></p><p begin="01:24.141" end="01:33.279" itunes:key="L12">この感情が残る限り<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我便终会向你奔赴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko no ka n jo u ga no ko ru ka gi ri</span></p><p begin="01:48.828" end="01:54.162" itunes:key="L13">まぶたを開くと眩しい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">张开双眼后 感到一阵炫目</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma bu ta wo hi ra ku to ma bu shi i</span></p><p begin="01:54.163" end="02:03.697" itunes:key="L14">光に覆われ夢と消えた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">视线被光芒笼罩 一切消散梦中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka ri ni o o wa re yu me he to ki e ta</span></p><p begin="02:03.698" end="02:11.488" itunes:key="L15">眠るのもいい 遊ぶのもいい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不论我陷入沉眠也好 尽情玩耍也罢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne mu ru no mo i i a so bu no mo i i</span></p><p begin="02:11.489" end="02:19.241" itunes:key="L16">好きなものはないけど<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心底不再有喜欢的事物</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su ki na mo no wa na i ke do</span></p><p begin="02:20.279" end="02:22.222" itunes:key="L17">さよなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">再见 再见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra sa yo na ra</span></p><p begin="02:22.223" end="02:24.148" itunes:key="L18">さよなら</p><p begin="02:24.149" end="02:26.058" itunes:key="L19">どこまでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我曾深爱的时光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo tsu zu ku yo u ni a i shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:26.059" end="02:28.000" itunes:key="L20">続くように</p><p begin="02:28.001" end="02:34.681" itunes:key="L21">愛したそんな日々</p><p begin="02:35.726" end="02:37.640" itunes:key="L22">会いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想见你 好想见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta i a i ta i</span></p><p begin="02:37.641" end="02:39.592" itunes:key="L23">会いたい</p><p begin="02:39.593" end="02:41.519" itunes:key="L24">会いたいって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望相见的心 究竟是怎样的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta i 't te na n da ro</span></p><p begin="02:41.520" end="02:43.416" itunes:key="L25">なんだろ？</p><p begin="02:43.417" end="02:50.227" itunes:key="L26">それすら遠くなる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连这份心意 都已逐渐抽远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re su ra to o ku na ru</span></p><p begin="02:50.722" end="02:57.869" itunes:key="L27">梅雨も軒をくぐって駆け抜けた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">穿过梅雨下的屋檐 一路跑来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu yu no no ki wo ku gu 't te ka ke nu ke ta</span></p><p begin="02:57.870" end="03:05.487" itunes:key="L28">金木犀の匂いのする頃<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">丹桂的气息萦绕鼻尖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki n mo ku se i no ni o i no su ru ko ro</span></p><p begin="03:06.877" end="03:08.639" itunes:key="L29">行くから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">等等我 我将去往你身边</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu ku ka ra ma 't te te</span></p><p begin="03:08.640" end="03:10.488" itunes:key="L30">待ってて</p><p begin="03:10.489" end="03:12.462" itunes:key="L31">それまで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请期待我们相见之时吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re ma de ta no shi mi ni</span></p><p begin="03:12.463" end="03:14.371" itunes:key="L32">楽しみに</p><p begin="03:14.372" end="03:21.211" itunes:key="L33">おもちゃも持ってゆく<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我会带上玩具去见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">o mo cha mo mo 't te yu ku</span></p><p begin="03:22.208" end="03:24.093" itunes:key="L34">会いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想见你 好想见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta i a i ta i</span></p><p begin="03:24.094" end="03:26.057" itunes:key="L35">会いたい</p><p begin="03:26.058" end="03:27.942" itunes:key="L36">いつか行く<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">纵使所有的一切都消散无踪 我都终会为你奔赴</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i tsu ka yu ku na ni mo ka mo ki e te mo</span></p><p begin="03:27.943" end="03:36.700" itunes:key="L37">なにもかも消えてももう一度</p><p begin="03:37.628" end="03:39.604" itunes:key="L38">さよなら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我不会向你说再见</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">sa yo na ra i wa na i</span></p><p begin="03:39.605" end="03:41.551" itunes:key="L39">言わない</p><p begin="03:41.552" end="03:43.460" itunes:key="L40">どこまでも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这片天 似将无限延伸</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ma de mo tsu zu ku yo u na</span></p><p begin="03:43.461" end="03:45.390" itunes:key="L41">続くような</p><p begin="03:45.391" end="03:52.150" itunes:key="L42">蒼をたたえた空<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">讴歌澄澈湛蓝</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a o wo ta ta e ta so ra</span></p><p begin="03:53.141" end="03:55.063" itunes:key="L43">会いたい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我好想见你 好想见你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta i a i ta i</span></p><p begin="03:55.064" end="03:57.008" itunes:key="L44">会いたい</p><p begin="03:57.009" end="03:58.914" itunes:key="L45">会いたいって<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">渴望相见的心 究竟是怎样的</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i ta i 't te na n da ro</span></p><p begin="03:58.915" end="04:00.900" itunes:key="L46">なんだろ？</p><p begin="04:00.901" end="04:43.999" itunes:key="L47">それすら遠くなる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">就连这份心意 都已逐渐抽远</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so re su ra to o ku na ru</span></p></div></body></tt>